    "body": "## Problem\n\n`vim.diagnostic.Opts.VirtualText` has a `source` option to prefix\ndiagnostic messages with their source (`'if_many'` or always), but the\nnewer `virtual_lines` handler never got the same option, even though\nthe shared helpers it needs\n(`diagnostic_shared.prefix_source`/`count_sources`) are already\nrender-target-agnostic and used by `virtual_text` as-is.\n\n## Solution\n\nAdd the same `source` field to `vim.diagnostic.Opts.VirtualLines` and\napply it in the `virtual_lines` handler right after message\nformatting, mirroring `virtual_text`'s own ordering (format the\nmessage first, then prefix the source onto the result).",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-15T17:10:00Z",
